## Important Notes

### For AI Agent

- **Always remove** INSTRUCTION, FORMAT, and EXAMPLE labels from output
- **Focus on specificity** - concrete numbers, real file paths, actual system names
- **Ask clarifying questions** if information is missing
- **Read template file** when user requests artifact creation
- **Validate before presenting** using appropriate Quality Checks
- **Configure Notion via MCP** - never copy properties section to description

### Content Guidelines

- **Epic:** Business language for stakeholders (executives, PMs, business analysts)
- **Story:** Conceptual architecture for PMs, Solution Architects, Tech Leads
- **Task:** Implementation details for Developers who will write the code

### List Formatting Standards

- Use **numbered lists** (`1. 2. 3.`) for sequential/ordered items
- Use **simple bullets** (`-`) for unordered items
- **No checkboxes** (`- [ ]`) in artifact descriptions

